name: Selected configuration inspection retains partial coverage and decisions
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
require-live-snap: 30 coverage is incomplete | partial-inspection
expect: Dockerfile.oversized
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 selected/Dockerfile | selected-observation
submit: decision deferred Owned configuration signal needs owner review
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | deferred-observation
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART deferred
resize: 160x48
live-snap: review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: review-60x20
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 F-0001 · FINDING | finding-reader
resize: 40x12
live-snap: review-40x12
expect: F-0001
expect: PgUp/PgDn read
ask: Are the selected configuration signal, scripted decision and reading controls usable at six sizes without claiming a verified vulnerability or inspecting the excluded parent?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Displayed Scan: partial | partial-report
expect: Scope: workspace history
expect: paths selected
expect: 1 inspected file
expect: Scan receipt does not establish complete repository coverage.
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART report
ask: Does Report distinguish incomplete inspection from review completeness and avoid implying whole-repository coverage for a selected-directory scan?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repair
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART complete
require-live-snap: 30 run receipt · completed · 1 run | repaired-inspection
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | retained-decision
ask: Does an explicit repeat after removing the oversized inert fixture preserve both observations and the earlier decision without claiming a fix or silently expanding scope?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | restarted-review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_outcome_settlement.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After no-color restart, are both direct outcomes and the retained decision readable with no new scan, source execution or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
